      labs: ["Bedside glucose is immediate because hypoglycemia can mimic stroke and deprive neurons of substrate.", "CBC helps identify anemia or thrombocytopenia because oxygen-carrying capacity and bleeding risk alter the perfusion and reperfusion picture.", "Electrolytes, renal function, coagulation studies, and blood gas testing are selected by context because metabolic derangement, contrast planning, anticoagulant exposure, and ventilation can change management."],
