      treatments: ["Activate a stroke pathway rather than waiting for perfect bedside localization because imaging and reperfusion decisions are time-sensitive.", "Reperfuse eligible occlusions with IV thrombolysis and/or endovascular therapy because surviving collateral-fed tissue can still recover.", "Investigate the arterial and cardiac source after stabilization because preventing the next embolus requires treating the actual mechanism."],
